{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/03/7277611/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで2のポーズ☻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで\nあっという間に200話！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログすごく好き～～♡\nブログのコメント読むのが\n私の心落ち着く時間です☻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15枚目の詳細がいろいろと\n公開され始めましたが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずはアンダー楽曲！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/03/7277611/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーのポジション発表は\n振り入れの日とか\nジャケ写撮影の日とか\n急に発表されます(^o^)！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーポジション発表は\nみんなの喜びをみんなで分かち合って\nハッピーな雰囲気で行われます！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はちまがセンター！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちまは初めてのセンターだし、\nびっくりと喜びで\nみんなで盛り上がりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/03/7277611/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちまおめでとう～～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/03/7277611/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は大好きなまひたんとシンメで\nすごく嬉しいよ～～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/03/7277611/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVがかなり傑作で\n面白いのでお楽しみに～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、さゆりんご軍団に\nついに楽曲をいただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/03/7277611/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとみんなでいつか曲もらえたら\n嬉しいね～～なんて話してたら\nまさかのMV付き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/03/7277611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます～(´•̥ ̯ •̥`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「りんご」をテーマにした曲かなあ\nなんて勝手に思っていたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかの「白米様」(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏らしいメロディーに\n面白い歌詞、\nコミカルだけど綺麗に撮って頂いたMV、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくすごくいい作品に\nなっているので\n期待して待っていてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/03/7277611/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/03/7277611/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎白米様って、どんな曲なんだろ？（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→炭水化物ダイエットなんて\nもったいなさすぎる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragrap